<title>POLAND: Kruszwica down 8 pct on bourse debut.</title>
<headline>Kruszwica down 8 pct on bourse debut.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish edible-fats maker  Kruszwica SA started trading on the main market of the Warsaw bourse on Monday at 23 zlotys, eight percent lower than its December public offering price of 25 zlotys.</p>
<p>The state treasury offered 1.65 million shares in the firm, or 25 percent of its equity, at the minimum price of 25 zlotys per share at a special bourse session on December 23.</p>
<p>It sold 1.27 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
